  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AZBH5Ig.png\" width=\"1128\" height=\"335\"></p><pre style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">模組介紹</span><br>本模組新增5種近戰武器，更多內容即將推出。</span></pre><pre style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">每種武器皆擁有專屬3D模型與高解析度材質。</span></pre><pre style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">部分武器具備被動技能或主動技能，以及隱藏屬性。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">部分主動技能設有冷卻時間或會消耗物品耐久度。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">所有武器皆可如普通武器般進行附魔。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">每種武器均新增背包修復配方，亦可透過鐵砧修復。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">這些武器雖難以取得，但絕對物超所值！ :)</span><br><br></pre><pre style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;各武器詳細說明</span></pre><div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<pre class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/amaZx0P.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"544\" height=\"306\"><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">合成材料：3個原木</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">傷害：5點生命值</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">攻擊速度：1</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">耐久度：490</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">修復材料：任意原木</span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wksONEX.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"544\" height=\"306\"><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">以棒球棒結合獄髓錠合成</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">傷害：8點生命值</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">攻擊速度：1.2</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">耐久度：1366</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">修復材料：獄髓錠</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">被動技能：20%機率使目標殘廢，造成2秒緩速與虛弱效果</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">主動技能：玩家進入10秒狂暴狀態，獲得力量爆發</span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NuF9e9p.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"544\" height=\"280\"><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">從綠寶石礦掉落（0.5%機率）</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">傷害：6點生命值</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">攻擊速度：2.5</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">耐久度：1600</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">修復材料：綠寶石方塊或於背包中緩慢恢復耐久度</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">被動技能：擊中敵人時有1%機率使其掉落綠寶石與經驗值</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">主動技能：獲得30秒「村莊英雄」效果</span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CwY8MMs.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"544\" height=\"280\"><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">從凋零骷髏掉落（1%機率）</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">傷害：10點生命值</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">攻擊速度：2</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">耐久度：3066</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">修復材料：獄髓方塊</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">被動技能：擊中時5%機率使敵人凋零並恢復自身7點生命值</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">主動技能：玩家向前大幅突進</span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ocuU9dV.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"544\" height=\"280\"><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">從凋零怪掉落（25%機率）</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">傷害：30點生命值</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">攻擊速度：0.35</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">耐久度：6700</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">修復材料：凋零骷髏頭顱</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">被動技能：生物頭顱掉落率提升20%</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">被動技能：5%機率使敵人在擊中時爆炸</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">主動技能：引發5次連續爆炸，最終爆炸威力最強</span><br><br></pre>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">相容性</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">與 <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a></span> 相容</span></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">其他專案</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">模組</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">BN Blood Particles - 本模組新增多種血跡粒子效果，現在所有傷害都將伴隨噴濺的血花！</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bn-blood-particles\" rel=\"nofollow\">BN - Blood Particles</a></span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">模組包</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">TTS - 以殭屍末日為主題的硬核模組合集！</span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/tts-try-to-survive\" rel=\"nofollow\">TTS - Try to Survive!</a></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kUrkrgfMzm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WERgnxz.jpg\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"200\" height=\"57\"></a></p>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">若有改進模組的構想或發現任何錯誤，請至Discord分享！</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">您亦可在此即時追蹤所有更新，有時還能取得模組測試版本。</span></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>",
